redited with discovering the source behind the ubiquitous filler text. In seeing a sample of lorem ipsum, his interest was piqued by consectetur—a genuine, albeit rare, Latin word. Consulting a Latin dictionary led McClintock to a passage from De Finibus Bonorum et Malorum (“On the Extremes of Good and Evil”), a first-century B.C. text from the Roman philosopher Cicero.'=>'Richard McClintock, a Latin scholar from Hampden-Sydney College, is credited with discovering the source behind the ubiquitous filler text. In seeing a sample of lorem ipsum, his interest was piqued by consectetur—a genuine, albeit rare, Latin word. Consulting a Latin dictionary led McClintock to a passage from De Finibus Bonorum et Malorum (“On the Extremes of Good and Evil”), a first-century B.C. text from the Roman philosopher Cicero.','Pattern titleTag Header'=>'Nagłówek tagu','Articles tagged with "%s"'=>'Artykuły oznaczone tagiem "%s"','Browse All Topics'=>'Przeglądaj wszystkie tematy','Pattern titleTag Posts Grid'=>'Siatka postów tagu','No articles found with this tag'=>'Nie znaleziono artykułów z tym tagiem','Articles with this tag are coming soon!'=>'Artykuły z tym tagiem już wkrótce!','Pattern title404 Template'=>'Szablon 404','OOPS! Page Not Found!'=>'OOPS! Strona nie została znaleziona!','Go to Homepage'=>'Przejdź do strony głównej','Helpful Link'=>'Pomocny link','Something went wrong! We couldn’t find the page you were looking for. But don’t worry, we’ve got some other Links that might be helpful:'=>'Coś poszło nie tak! Nie mogliśmy znaleźć szukanej strony. Bez obaw, mamy inne linki, które mogą się przydać:','404Pages'=>'Strony','404Categories'=>'Kategorie','404Posts'=>'Posty','No posts found.'=>'Nie znaleziono postów.','Pattern titleTestimonial Section'=>'Sekcja opinii','Hear From Our Happy Clients: Their Stories'=>'Posłuchaj naszych zadowolonych klientów: ich historie','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolo